<title>USA: Kellwood Q2 sales up on marketing efforts.</title>
<headline>Kellwood Q2 sales up on marketing efforts.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kellwood Co said Tuesday second-quarter sales rose one percent to a record $429 million thanks in part to its marketing programs and initiatives.</p>
<p>&quot;Kellwood has taken steps to enhance its competitive position by containing overhead spending and shifting more contractor production from domestic to offshore,&quot; said William McKenna, Kellwood's chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Net income in the period rose three percent to $14.4 million, said Kellwood.</p>
<p>Kellwood is a manufacturer and marketer of apparel.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
